### Actuator smoke checks (/actuator/**, permitAll)
### Useful right after startup to confirm the app, DB and Redis are wired up.

### 1. Liveness/readiness - should report status UP once Postgres + Redis are reachable.
GET {{host}}/actuator/health

###

### 2. Build/app info.
GET {{host}}/actuator/info

###

### 3. Prometheus scrape endpoint.
### NOTE: not available when running with the "local" profile - it caps
### exposure to health,info and sets prometheus access to "none"
### (see application-local.yaml). Use the default profile against the
### full stack (or drop those two overrides locally) to try this one.
GET {{host}}/actuator/prometheus

###
